        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "observation",
        "position_hint": 0.35,
        "text": "Marco Sylva, thanks for being here."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "insight:235ac690e3034ff4",
      "properties": {
        "episode_id": "a283fe88-fdec-51b4-8014-431b4a7ce670",
        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "recommendation",
        "position_hint": 0.5,
        "text": "Excited for this one \u2014 wreck-diving fundamentals is something I've been thinking about a lot."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:speaker-02",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Marco Sylva"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:7cbc9613a90aedb9",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 314,
        "char_start": 207,
        "episode_id": "a283fe88-fdec-51b4-8014-431b4a7ce670",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Thanks, Rina. Excited for this one \u2014 wreck-diving fundamentals is something I've been thinking about a lot.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 12000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 6000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p03_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:speaker-01",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Rina"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:ab8e94af6a64c7e8",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 447,
        "char_start": 321,
        "episode_id": "a283fe88-fdec-51b4-8014-431b4a7ce670",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "This episode is brought to you by Suunto. Suunto builds dive computers and outdoor watches. Get started at suunto.com/podcast.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 18000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 12000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p03_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:7abe82758771a250",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 553,
        "char_start": 447,
        "episode_id": "a283fe88-fdec-51b4-8014-431b4a7ce670",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "What does the failure mode look like? What's something you used to believe about this that you've revised?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p03_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:fb85d8eb5fca6091",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 796,
        "char_start": 567,
        "episode_id": "a283fe88-fdec-51b4-8014-431b4a7ce670",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Let me give you the version I actually believe. Wreck penetration is a planning problem first, a buoyancy problem second. We've seen this play out at teams using GoPro. I've watched this pattern hold across three different teams.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p03_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:8bd9e682f5eca10c",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 878,
        "char_start": 803,
        "episode_id": "a283fe88-fdec-51b4-8014-431b4a7ce670",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "I want to dig into that. Where do dive planning and wreck diving intersect?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p03_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:d5590413650122dd",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1056,
        "char_start": 892,
        "episode_id": "a283fe88-fdec-51b4-8014-431b4a7ce670",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Honestly, Silt-out from poor finning technique kills more divers in wrecks than equipment failures. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p03_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    }
  ],
